{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"aa25c71533260bfa601ab3ef0ce803bbb23f14d9ec8447882f31ba61916cbffd","ja":"教えて、歌織先生！","zh":"教教我吧，歌织老师！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f7607edbd899209b03f8518d3e377f2b3c97a11792ba73c90bb2e885c703b5d8","ja":"あっ、桜守さん。\nわざわざお呼びしてしまってすみません。","zh":"啊，桜守。\n特意把你叫来，真是抱歉。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1157b8bc05c0a9ba29f2deb2566d40ee76245d255c51dcaa74c17e2d883d2ec8","ja":"全然大丈夫よ♪\nそれで、相談って何かしら？","zh":"完全没问题哦♪\n那么，想找我商量什么事呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"78dbc42a777d172b6cfa62aa1670785c63d58a5c51c62c667e139e67938b2420","ja":"はい、ぜひお伺いしたくて……。\n子どもたちに好かれる極意を！","zh":"是的，我很想向您请教……\n受小孩子们喜欢的秘诀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c7a53d128a6114e1bca27af37a01b5092e233a4dd035b5eb34b0e191a9e1902e","ja":"……えっ！？","zh":"……诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a13a2c77d723760d7b5f140d2bfb13e9a7b541ec624d7d3c1e0cc9ade4783304","ja":"ああ、今度のお仕事の話だったのね。\n突然のことでびっくりしちゃった。","zh":"啊，原来是说下次工作的事呀。\n太突然了，吓了我一跳。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7b86cd03c1b761605d83912018081c859ba87e92224945c6fec3e5679d5ea871","ja":"確か幼稚園の子どもたちと、\nバラエティ番組で共演するのよね。","zh":"记得是和小朋友们\n一起出演综艺节目对吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"74298b339c5927b7073981786363c1b76ef7dcc40f27387798547041f89aa891","ja":"はい。それで音楽教室の先生として子どもたちと\n接してきた桜守さんに、助言をいただければと。","zh":"是的。所以才想请教曾作为音乐教室老师\n接触过孩子们的樱守小姐，希望您能给点建议。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e782cff4222731785e9ce3bbc710e81a57c5c45041542b0b360314a0599fd78c","ja":"ん～……でも、私も子どもたちの\nプロフェッショナルというわけじゃないけど……。","zh":"嗯～……不过，我也算不上\n应对小孩子的专家就是了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7c7f228d8eceb7e4a775e43dfa641a428b5c0c3fbb8ccc1f783b21bba45f0a42","ja":"例えば、人見知りの子がいた場合は、\nどのような接し方をすれば良いでしょうか？","zh":"比如，如果遇到怕生认生的孩子，\n应该怎样和她接触呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"82cb52e69d9c77134c244a16c57cd09a33527256c6f0aba9a1cdfc7df718819d","ja":"そうね……あっ、そういう子とも、\nピアノを通して、自然に仲良くなれた気はするわ。","zh":"也是呢……啊，我觉得就算是那样的孩子，\n通过钢琴，似乎也自然而然地就成为朋友了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"f0f9b240b4c39a439cd181e5c36b48e9cb79d9d32d1452d2fdef2f16cafac092","ja":"そうそう、だから今度のお仕事も、\nピアノをお借りしようと思ってるの♪","zh":"对呀，所以下次的工作，\n我也打算借用一下钢琴呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4c462f03b670ac0e7c28ee754c0088350c5ef763a491d507826734700397e5ff","ja":"ピアノを通して交流を……素敵ですね！\n私も三味線なら演奏できますが……。","zh":"通过钢琴来进行交流……真棒呢！\n虽然我也能弹奏三味线就是了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"73a8c588daeb89bf18d5f420e9fee709c0efbf9ce3b7bf1e5d2392039920b496","ja":"それ、すごくいいと思うわ♪　初めて三味線を\n見る子もいるだろうし、きっと楽しんでもらえるわよ。","zh":"我觉得那个非常不错哦♪　应该也有孩子是第一次\n见到三味线，大家一定能乐在其中的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1239.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9c7610d94a95f8f2593ffefad0231ee4a00f5833cb7991430001e687275a67cf","ja":"なるほど……やはり桜守さんのお話は参考になります。\n他にもコツがありましたら、ぜひご教授ください！","zh":"原来如此……樱守小姐的见解果然很有参考价值。\n如果还有其他窍门的话，请务必教教我！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
